# Managed upstream clone; the integration and release pin are tracked separately.
vendor/concat/

# The design tool's scratchpad. Nearly all of it is screenshot output that the
# Playwright and preview suites rewrite on every run, so keeping it out of Git
# avoids endless churn. The exceptions below are text files that DESIGN.md and
# docs/design/dashboard-validation.md cite as normative contracts and review
# records: a contract that only exists on one laptop is not a contract, so those
# few files are version-controlled.
#
# Images stay ignored on purpose. The app captures are regenerable test output
# (see docs/QA-HARNESS.md), and the Pinterest reference rasters are someone
# else's work - DESIGN.md states that no reference raster ships.
.impeccable/*
!.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/review/*
!.impeccable/review/*/
.impeccable/review/*/*
!.impeccable/review/*/finish-review.md
!.impeccable/review/pinterest-dashboard/measurements.json
!.impeccable/review/pinterest-dashboard/detector.json
!.impeccable/surfaces/
